                        ],
                        "form": "Leitkulturen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6909d934-7a7d-31a4-8df4-f73be2c0ce60",
                        "entry_id": "9e9ea19d-36c6-3ffd-96d3-00c8c08f7747",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The values of modern Western culture, including democracy, secularism, the Enlightenment, human rights, and civil society."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6581bd9c-1c8f-3a08-9dcb-e7b1ce9cb063",
                        "entry_id": "9e9ea19d-36c6-3ffd-96d3-00c8c08f7747",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The dominant culture of a country, especially in political discourse about immigration and integration."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bb6bf6b-8d42-4ec1-81de-7c2b5789fc0e",
                                "sense_id": "6581bd9c-1c8f-3a08-9dcb-e7b1ce9cb063",
                                "text": "Zur maßgeblichen Leitkultur zählt [Friedrich] Merz beispielsweise die Überzeugung, dass auch die Zuwanderer einen eigenen Integrationsbeitrag leisten müssten; dass sie sich dabei anpassen müssten an die in diesem Land gewachsenen kulturellen Grund-Vorstellungen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3e3cece-ca63-4481-8d93-718ddba68edf",
                                "sense_id": "6581bd9c-1c8f-3a08-9dcb-e7b1ce9cb063",
                                "text": "Mit der Mitte in die Zukunft heißt Tradition pur! / Der Exportschlager aus Deutschland heißt für immer Leitkultur",
                                "translation": "With the middle into the future, tradition is called pure! / The export hit from Germany will always be called 'Leitkultur'",
                                "english": "With the middle into the future, tradition is called pure! / The export hit from Germany will always be called 'Leitkultur'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "738ebae7-f43a-42c7-9321-faf137bea308",
                                "sense_id": "6581bd9c-1c8f-3a08-9dcb-e7b1ce9cb063",
                                "text": "In ganz Europa erstarkt der Nationalismus. Grenzen werden geschlossen, Leitkulturen beschworen, Das-Boot-ist-voll-Rhetorik dominiert.",
                                "translation": "In all of Europe nationalism is getting stronger. Borders are being closed, dominant cultures invoked, the-boat-is-full-rhetoric dominates.",
                                "english": "In all of Europe nationalism is getting stronger. Borders are being closed, dominant cultures invoked, the-boat-is-full-rhetoric dominates."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38399713-54ad-4962-885a-24a0ef3d6d23",
                                "sense_id": "6581bd9c-1c8f-3a08-9dcb-e7b1ce9cb063",
                                "text": "Martin Sellner erklärt zu den Enthüllungen denn auch, sein Plan sei gar nicht geheim, sondern werde „im patriotischen Lager breit und öffentlich diskutiert“ und er umfasse „nicht nur Abschiebungen, sondern auch Leitkultur und Assimilationsdruck“.",
                                "translation": "So in response to the revelations Martin Sellner also declares that the plan isn't secret at all, but that it's “widely and openly discussed in the patriotic camp”, and that it comprises “not only deportations, but also dominant culture and assimilation pressure”.",
                                "english": "So in response to the revelations Martin Sellner also declares that the plan isn't secret at all, but that it's “widely and openly discussed in the patriotic camp”, and that it comprises “not only deportations, but also dominant culture and assimilation pressure”."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
